# SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
# Copied to /etc/twes-in/staging-follow.env on the staging machine (docs/RUNBOOK.md); read by twes-staging-follow.service.
# The checkout staging-follow.sh moves from commit to commit, and nothing else uses.
TWES_CHECKOUT=/srv/twes-in
# Where publish.sh pushes the images; public, so the machine needs no registry credential.
TWES_REGISTRY=ghcr.io/tmessaoudi-official
# The values new-instance.sh --staging wrote; releases/ is kept beside them.
TWES_VALUES=/etc/twes-in/deploy.env
# How often staging asks the registry: a whole number of s, min or h, at least 1min; 5min when unset. The timer reads
# no environment: scripts/deploy/staging-follow-interval.sh writes it over the timer, run again after a change.
# STAGING_FOLLOW_INTERVAL=5min
